!include _style.iuml
@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 18
title Media acceptance -> relay -> Processing inbox
start
if (new source path?) then (upload)
 :reserve -> client S3 POST -> finalize\nverify bytes / VersionId;
 :Media SQL transaction:\nrecheck reservation + adopt Asset / pin\n+ stage submit outbox;
else (edit)
 :owned completed parent -> copy primary\npin new derived source;
 :Media SQL transaction:\nnew Asset + SourceVersion + optional RequestKey\n+ submit outbox, retire staged-object row;
endif
:COMMIT acceptance;
:MediaRepair: claim outbox + COMMIT\nrelay SendMessage -> SQS\nfenced send acknowledgement;
:ProcessingCommands receives from mapping;
:Processing SQL transaction:\ninbox + guard + Job / Attempt\n+ work / result outboxes, COMMIT;
:handler attempts publication after commit;
:ACK depends on committed inbox / state / intent;
stop
legend bottom
 HTTP response and relay scheduling are independent.
 SQS sends are outside the adoption transaction.
 Relay/repair can repeat; inbox and lifecycle fences deduplicate.
endlegend
@enduml
